  "integration": {
    "lifecycle": [
      "mount(element, options)",
      "update(options)",
      "destroy()"
    ],
    "persistence": "Caller-owned; no runtime localStorage",
    "content": "Plain strings or explicit DOM Nodes; no HTML string evaluation",
    "data": "label, disabled, type, onClick, appearance: {fill, ink, border, shadow}, variant: primary | split | secondary | ghost",
    "api": "`mount(container, options)` \u2192 `element` (the native button), `update(options)`, `destroy()`. The Split action arrow is decorative; the entire button invokes one action. Disabled state uses native button semantics."
  },
